    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SGT. DIAZ: I’m Sergeant Diaz. I am not your friend. This is. It will keep you alive. You will not clean, disassemble or modify your friend.\nSGT. DIAZ: Your friend likes to party.\nSGT. DIAZ: You’ll need to feed your friend these party favors if you want to party with your friend.\nSGT. DIAZ: Now we can party.",
      "LT. HART: You are R-Force - also known as Research Force. You’ll be joining your counterparts in 2051 at a fortified research facility. Your function …\nLT. HART: D Force are your bodies on the ground --\nSGT. DIAZ: Necks and bellies! That’s what you aim for!",
      "SGT. DIAZ: Okay. Good Luck. I’m sure the aliens will understand.\nLT. HART: D-Force will buy you time to get your work done.\nNORAH: Why can’t we just keep jumping back to earlier in the war?",
      "LT. HART: What the...\nSGT. DIAZ: Those aren’t Whitespikes.",
      "SGT. DIAZ: We can’t let them escape.\nLT. HART: Let’s go end our war.\nLT. HART: We need to get them cornered. Come on!"
    ]
  },
